# Generated data. Local and regenerable from the construction programs (INV-7);
# releases go to Zenodo, not to git (spec/architecture.md §2).
#
# Written as `data/*` rather than `data/` deliberately: git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded, and `data/LICENSE` (CC-BY-4.0) has to
# be committable at M1.
data/*
!data/LICENSE

*.parquet

# Python and notebook scratch.
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Not listed, because they already exclude themselves: `venv/` and
# `.pytest_cache/` each contain a `.gitignore` written by the tool that made
# them. A differently-named environment directory would need adding here.

# Transport file for handing state to another assistant session. Never a
# project document, never committed.
handover.md

# Per-machine editor/tooling config.
.vscode/
pyrightconfig.json
